{"id":138055123286050,"name":"[UPD] Poly Drifters","desc":"🔥 Welcome to Poly Drifters! 🔥\n\nJump into a fast-paced drifting experience where style, control, and precision earn you cash. Drift through corners, chain huge drift combos, and build your dream car collection!\n\n🚧 EARLY DEVELOPMENT\nThis game is still being actively developed — expect updates, new cars, and improvements! Some bugs may occur.\n\n🏎️ FEATURES\n\n💨 Smooth, satisfying drifting mechanics\n💸 Earn cash from drift score combos\n🚗 Unlock and collect unique cars\n🎨 Custom tire smoke & tuning options\n🌆 Open maps perfect for car meets & free driving\n📈 Progression system with upgrades and rewards\n\n🎮 CONTROLS\n\nW, A, S, D — Drive\nH — Headlights\nShift + P — Freecam\n\n🔥 WHY PLAY?\nMaster your drifting skills, show off your style, and compete for the highest scores.\n\n🙏 Inspired by: Mall Drifters / Mini Drifters\n\n🏁 TAGS\ndrift, drifting, drift simulator, car game, driving, racing, cars, tuning, customization, multiplayer, car meet, open world, drifting game","path":"/game/138055123286050-poly-drifters","slug":"138055123286050-poly-drifters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b9c6c3cc6c00d91b5207c2bf8001e78b4517e194d0203eec51ca3f5f172108f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-16c30a9e794a614f84c3e4fbefd6eac3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":312400,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-02T05:38:41.880Z","creator":{"name":"PolyForge Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"UPD-Poly-Drifters-Inf-money-and-metres-176671","_id":"69ce00e149ed2bc969ab78ca","title":"Inf money and metres","game":{"_id":"69ce00e149ed2bc969ab78c7","gameId":138055123286050,"name":"[UPD] Poly Drifters","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":138055123286050},"features":"giv